              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu owaateire Omwana wa Ruhanga omugyere, akateekateeka aha shagama y'endagaano ei yaayeziibwemu okuba etaine mugasho, akarogota aha Mwoyo ow'embabazi, nimuteekateeka ngu tashemereire kifubiro kihango ekirikukira ekyabo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.29"
            ]
